{"2879970": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Interstate Cowboys", "steam_appid": 2879970, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the neon-soaked streets of Neo Vista City, where the gleaming promise of the near future collides with the grit of the urban underbelly. In <i><strong>Interstate Cowboys</strong></i>, you embark on a new RPG adventure from the creators of the <strong>award-winning <i>Vaudeville</i></strong>.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879970/extras/fa63d07f1954cf0cb128d84fe4a4510a.poster.avif?t=1781376718\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879970/extras/fa63d07f1954cf0cb128d84fe4a4510a.webm?t=1781376718\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879970/extras/fa63d07f1954cf0cb128d84fe4a4510a.mp4?t=1781376718\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the heart of the city as <strong>Driver Zero</strong>, a fresh face in a metropolis crawling with secrets, corruption, and danger. Join forces with the dynamic duo Dexter &amp; Alex as they navigate the treacherous currents of the <strong>criminal underworld</strong>. Challenge the mob leader known as the Baron, or align yourself with him for a share of the city’s dirty business.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879970/extras/571917c59170ad17d00505808f3889a4.avif?t=1781376718\" width=640 height=360 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Interstate Cowboys</strong></i> features a <strong>completely reworked dialogue system</strong> that blends scripted sequences with dynamic conversations, creating multiple branching paths and meaningful consequences for both your words and your actions. Beyond dialogue, the game delivers <i>high-octane driving, deep car customization, tactical operations, and a reputation system</i> that tracks your standing with the city’s powerful factions and key figures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879970/extras/8b7e73e4058134aeac185f17543310ae.avif?t=1781376718\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879970/extras_big/8b7e73e4058134aeac185f17543310ae.avif?t=1781376718 width=800 height=131 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Interstate Cowboys ride the thin line between chaos and order, revenge and justice, life and death. They’ll seize any opportunity to hustle their way into the city’s businesses and power struggles. And in Neo Vista City, every opportunity comes with a cost.</i></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the neon-soaked streets of Neo Vista City, where the gleaming promise of the near future collides with the grit of the urban underbelly. In <i><strong>Interstate Cowboys</strong></i>, you embark on a new RPG adventure from the creators of the <strong>award-winning <i>Vaudeville</i></strong>.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879970/extras/fa63d07f1954cf0cb128d84fe4a4510a.poster.avif?t=1781376718\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879970/extras/fa63d07f1954cf0cb128d84fe4a4510a.webm?t=1781376718\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879970/extras/fa63d07f1954cf0cb128d84fe4a4510a.mp4?t=1781376718\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the heart of the city as <strong>Driver Zero</strong>, a fresh face in a metropolis crawling with secrets, corruption, and danger. Join forces with the dynamic duo Dexter &amp; Alex as they navigate the treacherous currents of the <strong>criminal underworld</strong>. Challenge the mob leader known as the Baron, or align yourself with him for a share of the city’s dirty business.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879970/extras/571917c59170ad17d00505808f3889a4.avif?t=1781376718\" width=640 height=360 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Interstate Cowboys</strong></i> features a <strong>completely reworked dialogue system</strong> that blends scripted sequences with dynamic conversations, creating multiple branching paths and meaningful consequences for both your words and your actions. Beyond dialogue, the game delivers <i>high-octane driving, deep car customization, tactical operations, and a reputation system</i> that tracks your standing with the city’s powerful factions and key figures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879970/extras/8b7e73e4058134aeac185f17543310ae.avif?t=1781376718\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879970/extras_big/8b7e73e4058134aeac185f17543310ae.avif?t=1781376718 width=800 height=131 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Interstate Cowboys ride the thin line between chaos and order, revenge and justice, life and death. They’ll seize any opportunity to hustle their way into the city’s businesses and power struggles. And in Neo Vista City, every opportunity comes with a cost.</i></p>", "short_description": "Interstate Cowboys is a role-playing game set in the street racing underworld of a dystopian near-future. It features an advanced dialogue system, high-octane driving, tactical gameplay, and a dynamic reputation system.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879970/eefc6788778786bf53b2cf6a6a0c9e5cf832d8f1/header.jpg?t=1781376718", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879970/cf5afc0fa3f58a5296f40c2ae94a14b6495b83d4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1781376718", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879970/cf5afc0fa3f58a5296f40c2ae94a14b6495b83d4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1781376718", "website": "http://www.bumblebee-studios.se/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 and Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 2.5 GHz / AMD Ryzen 5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia RTX 3050 / AMD RX6600<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 20 MB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 and Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7 2.8GHz / AMD Ryzen 7<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 32 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia RTX 4080 / AMD 7900<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 50 MB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 12.04 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual core from Intel